{
  "version": "2026-10-28",
  "source": "doc/19-v6/19v6-04-验收-curl.md",
  "note": [
    "本文件是契约字节的**机器真源**；doc/19-v6/19v6-04-验收-curl.md 是同一份内容的人读版。",
    "两份**同批改**。check-expected.sh 守两边的用例号集合一致。",
    "tier=core 的用例不需要模型，必须全过；tier=model 需要真实跑一轮（要 API Key 与网络）。",
    "expect 字段：http / code / message / data（子集比对：只断点名的键，值写 \"$any\" 是通配）/ data_keys（data 对象的键集与键序必须逐字相同）/ frame_kinds_contains / rows_len_equals / data_items_some（数组里**至少有一项**满足条件，如 {\"path\":\"workspaces\",\"match\":{\"id\":\"{wid}\",\"isDefault\":false}}——expect 里也能写 {var}）。",
    "step 字段：method / path / body / auth / sql（请求前先跑的 SQL）/ capture（把响应里的值存成变量）/ op=signup（建账号+租户+配模型）/ op=wait_terminal（等这一场跑完）。"
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "id": "0-signup",
      "case": "用例 0",
      "tier": "core",
      "desc": "注册 → 账号/租户/成员/accessToken 一并回来",
      "steps": [
        {
          "op": "signup",
          "expect": {
            "http": 201,
            "code": 0,
            "message": "",
            "data_keys": [
              "user",
              "tenant",
              "membership",
              "accessToken",
              "tokenType",
              "expiresIn",
              "refreshToken"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
